
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MEASURED CELL LOCALITY -- shared with ~/work/tpu_cmd/google3_tpu_utils/
#                           cell_locality.py, which is the source of truth.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This checkout keeps its OWN `_CELL_BUCKETS` above, on purpose: which CNS cell
# a project writes to inside a metro is that project's choice (this one uses
# a different tul cell from its siblings, and both are correct -- same metro,
# free cross-cell reads). What is NOT a matter of choice is which metro a cell
# is in, and that is what these rows carry.
#
# THE ROWS ARE COPIED, NOT IMPORTED, because this file is rsynced into a
# stagedir and built there, so it cannot reach ~/work/tpu_cmd. The copy is kept
# honest by `_assert_locality_sane()` below, which (a) re-derives every
# `_CELL_BUCKETS` row's metro from the measurement and REFUSES on a cross-metro
# row, and (b) diffs the rows against the source of truth when it is reachable.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   python3 ~/work/tpu_cmd/google3_tpu_utils/remeasure_cell_locality.py --write
#   python3 ~/work/tpu_cmd/google3_tpu_utils/sync_fork_locality.py --write
